to classify the original. New controls must include aliasing: XOR 3 gives
a repeating 1/2 pair but terminates from 0 or 3. The original reaching
object/value still needs evidence. Both source hashes match the localization
capture; original inputs, checksums and oracle-unusable verdicts stay intact.

